=== Regime-stability across universe ===

Tickers: 10  (order: AAPL, MSFT, GOOGL, AMZN, META, NVDA, TSLA, JPM, JNJ, XOM)
Verdict counts: CONSISTENT_WITH_NOISE=2, REGIME_STABLE=7, REGIME_STABLE_LOSS=0, REGIME_DEPENDENT=1

Per-asset regime-stability results:
  AAPL  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent, calm] candidate_medians=[+0.071, +0.054, +0.092, +0.069] dispersion=+0.014 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  MSFT  : segments=[calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.052, +0.072] dispersion=+0.010 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  GOOGL : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.069, +0.071, +0.101] dispersion=+0.015 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  AMZN  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.065, +0.076, +0.077] dispersion=+0.005 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  META  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.073, +0.067, +0.042] dispersion=+0.013 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  NVDA  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[-0.038, +0.013, +0.100] dispersion=+0.057 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  TSLA  : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.132, +0.016, +0.107] dispersion=+0.050 verdict=REGIME_STABLE
  JPM   : segments=[turbulent, calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.113, +0.044, +0.083] dispersion=+0.028 verdict=REGIME_DEPENDENT
  JNJ   : segments=[calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.000, +0.046] dispersion=+0.023 verdict=CONSISTENT_WITH_NOISE
  XOM   : segments=[calm, turbulent] candidate_medians=[+0.018, +0.037] dispersion=+0.009 verdict=CONSISTENT_WITH_NOISE

Interpretation: REGIME_STABLE = the candidate behaves the same way (same edge or no edge) across regimes; REGIME_STABLE_LOSS = the candidate loses money in every regime mix (stable losses, not an edge, and the verdict must be read alongside the medians); REGIME_DEPENDENT = results swing strongly across regimes relative to the coin-flip null (fits one regime); CONSISTENT_WITH_NOISE = indistinguishable from noise in every segment.

=== 5. Interpretation ===
  Verdict counts: CONSISTENT_WITH_NOISE=2, REGIME_STABLE=7, REGIME_STABLE_LOSS=0, REGIME_DEPENDENT=1
  A majority of assets show REGIME_STABLE behavior, suggesting the volatility gate creates a reproducible improvement in robustness for the momentum effect.

